'''Palossand''' (Japanese: '''シロデスナ''' ''Sirodethna'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

