==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Palossand|126}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Life Sucker''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Champion's Path|Hatterene|20}} from the {{TCG|Champion's Path}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

